{
  "job_B3.3.32_20251003_114718": {
    "chunk_text": "mon wregde to Nerone \u00fe\u00e6m casere, & Beforan \u00fe\u00e6s folces mengeo. & Nerones wif Libia, & Agrippan wif Agrippina to\u00feon swi\u00fee f\u00e6stlice hie sylfe to Cristes lufan & \u00d0a wear\u00fe Simon se dry eallunga aweht wi\u00fe \u00f0am apostolum & gel\u00e6red \u00fe\u00e6t he feala yfla s\u00e6gde, & \u00fe\u00e6t & ongean \u00feam Petrus. Mid anum worde, & blinde men mid his bedum geh\u00e6lde \u00fe\u00e6t hie locodan, & deoflum bebead \u00fe\u00e6t hie of Ond \u00fea gelamp \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6t ealle \u00e6f\u00e6ste men onscunodan Simon \u00feone dry, & hie hine scyldigne s\u00e6gdon. \u00deonne s\u00e6gdon \u00fea men \u00fee Simone folgodan \u00fe\u00e6t Petrus w\u00e6re dry, \u00fe\u00e6t ilce \u00fe\u00e6t Simon him sylf w\u00e6s, & \u00dea sona swa \u00fe\u00e6t word becom to Nerone \u00fe\u00e6m casere, \u00fea heht he Simon \u00feone dry infeccan beforan hine. & \u00fea \u00fea hwile \u00fee he \u00fe\u00e6r stod, he wear\u00fe f\u00e6ringa geong cniht, & sona eft eald man. Man, & br\u00e6d hine on feala bleona \u00feurh deofles \u00feegnunga. \u00dea Neron \u00fea \u00fe\u00e6t geseah \u00fea wende he \u00fe\u00e6t hit Godes Sunu w\u00e6re. \u00deonne s\u00e6gde Petrus \u00fe\u00e6t he w\u00e6re leas dry, & sceand & scyldig \u00e6swica, & on eallum Godes d\u00e6dum \u00dea eode Simon into Nerone & cw\u00e6\u00fe to him, Gehyr me dugo\u00fea casere: ic eom Godes Sunu \u00fee of \u00deonne for\u00feon ne m\u00e6g \u00fein rice leng stondan, buton \u00feu heora forwyrde \u00fee geornor \u00feence. & he \u00fea wear",
